0: //! Contiguous journals with position-based access.
1: //!
2: //! This module provides position-based journal implementations where items are stored
3: //! contiguously and can be accessed by their position (0-indexed). Both [fixed]-size and
4: //! [variable]-size item journals are supported.
5: //!
6: //! # Ownership
7: //!
8: //! Mutating methods take the journal by value and return it on success. If a mutating
9: //! method returns an error, or its future is dropped before it finishes, the journal is
10: //! gone: state that was not yet durable is discarded, but everything already on disk stays
11: //! recoverable.
